ing in, reshuffle and follow the active row. Preserve the pointer light, exact GSAP CustomEase, keyboard focus behavior, touch plain-list fallback and cleanup. The final light editorial section reads Built to stand apart with a real Liberty Walk link. This is an independent visual study, not an official affiliation, rental checkout or commercial permission to reuse third-party brand/model imagery. Preserve all credits. The supplied 2238 by 1292 recording is a reference/catalog preview only, never the runtime page background. Write every file below and download the exact public assets; no redesign or additional sections.

