## Build on a new computer

Use Node.js 22.12 or newer. After writing ALL the files below, run:

```sh
npm install
npm run assets
npm run build
npm run dev
```

The asset script downloads and verifies the exact media with SHA-256 before saving it into this new project. Keep these filenames: the source uses them. If a URL fails, report that URL; do not invent substitute media. Use the included local League Gothic, Yuji Boku, Anton, Caveat 600 and DM Sans 500 font files. Preserve their OFL license notices. No external font account is needed. No backend or payment service is supplied: preserve the reference's existing demo interactions.

